cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "DDoS Detection & Response Platform: layered rules + ML, an AI SOC analyst, and human-approved containment"
abstract: >-
  A layered DoS/DDoS detection and response platform. Rules and an ML ensemble detect attacks in real
  time, an LLM analyst (NVIDIA Nemotron) explains each incident and recommends a ranked containment plan,
  and every block requires a human administrator's approval before a time-limited rule is applied. It is
  evaluated on CIC-DDoS2019 and on live Mininet lab runs with dev and held-out sets kept separate.
type: software
